name texsurgery
category Package
revision 59885
shortdesc A LaTeX companion to the "texsurgery" python project
longdesc This LaTeX library is a companion to the texsurgery python
longdesc project. It will make sure that "pdflatex document.tex" will
longdesc work, with reasonable defaults, for a document that is intended
longdesc to work with texsurgery, and also has other uses, always in
longdesc tandem with the texsurgery pypi package.
